django-cors-headers:
=============================
a Django package used to handle CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing).

or 

It allows your frontend and backend to communicate when they are running on different origins.


Suppose you have:

Django backend → http://localhost:8000
React frontend → http://localhost:3000

Even though both are on your computer, the ports are different, so the browser considers them different origins.

